{"4060990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Bold Bogey", "steam_appid": 4060990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW TAKE ON GOLF </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge up your boosters to launch Bogey through a wide world filled with unique platforming challenges. Careful, you’ll need good timing and a keen eye to master these diabolical obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/9cc76e141a1f5202ae93ef89bc159538.avif?t=1786375028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/9cc76e141a1f5202ae93ef89bc159538.webp?t=1786375028 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple biomes hide both secrets and a wide variety of mechanics for you to play with and master. Revisit old areas with new powers to unlock additional challenges and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/34eef54cb5029b7772e8a137954ec75b.avif?t=1786375028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/34eef54cb5029b7772e8a137954ec75b.webp?t=1786375028 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the world four different dungeons hide four unique abilities to control Bogey. Slam in a completely different direction off a bounce pad or skip across water with speed. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/93929d909741729889a46d0505ef7d22.avif?t=1786375028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/93929d909741729889a46d0505ef7d22.webp?t=1786375028 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien parasite has landed and taken over the Elder Golf Gods. You play as Bogey, a robot golf ball who takes matters into its own hands to save the world. Fight the alien bosses across four dungeons to bring peace back to Albatropolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/2b943b567da5106de968c18748c3b1ad.avif?t=1786375028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/2b943b567da5106de968c18748c3b1ad.webp?t=1786375028 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW TAKE ON GOLF </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge up your boosters to launch Bogey through a wide world filled with unique platforming challenges. Careful, you’ll need good timing and a keen eye to master these diabolical obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/9cc76e141a1f5202ae93ef89bc159538.avif?t=1786375028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/9cc76e141a1f5202ae93ef89bc159538.webp?t=1786375028 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple biomes hide both secrets and a wide variety of mechanics for you to play with and master. Revisit old areas with new powers to unlock additional challenges and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/34eef54cb5029b7772e8a137954ec75b.avif?t=1786375028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/34eef54cb5029b7772e8a137954ec75b.webp?t=1786375028 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the world four different dungeons hide four unique abilities to control Bogey. Slam in a completely different direction off a bounce pad or skip across water with speed. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/93929d909741729889a46d0505ef7d22.avif?t=1786375028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/93929d909741729889a46d0505ef7d22.webp?t=1786375028 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien parasite has landed and taken over the Elder Golf Gods. You play as Bogey, a robot golf ball who takes matters into its own hands to save the world. Fight the alien bosses across four dungeons to bring peace back to Albatropolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/2b943b567da5106de968c18748c3b1ad.avif?t=1786375028\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras_big/2b943b567da5106de968c18748c3b1ad.webp?t=1786375028 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "The Bold Bogey is a 3D golf adventure that combines open exploration with satisfying platforming. Explore a vast world filled with dungeons to dive into, bosses to fight, and new ways to upgrade your ball in a golf game unlike any other. Do you have what it takes to become the Boldest Bogey?", "supported_la